WEBVTT

01:49.370 --> 01:54.979
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:57.910
[Episode 15]

02:04.120 --> 02:05.350
I'm Song Yimeng.

02:06.480 --> 02:07.940
Greetings, Your Majesty.

02:08.590 --> 02:09.400
Kneel.

02:12.870 --> 02:14.080
It's late,

02:14.840 --> 02:16.190
and I'm tired.

02:16.590 --> 02:18.320
So I won't beat around the bush.

02:20.150 --> 02:21.550
You're already engaged,

02:21.750 --> 02:23.750
yet you're tangled up with a prince,

02:24.400 --> 02:27.120
even pitting Rui and Heng
against each other.

02:27.710 --> 02:28.650
Tell me.

02:29.150 --> 02:31.750
What exactly are you
and your family plotting?

02:32.430 --> 02:33.230
Your Majesty,

02:34.790 --> 02:36.450
please don't misunderstand.

02:36.770 --> 02:39.000
My father raised me to steer clear

02:39.240 --> 02:41.280
of political factions.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.600
My engagement to Chu Guihong

02:43.910 --> 02:45.240
was arranged years ago.

02:45.560 --> 02:47.890
The rumors about the Seventh Prince and me

02:48.079 --> 02:49.560
are completely baseless.

02:54.150 --> 02:55.620
[Exceptional Love]

02:54.190 --> 02:55.450
You're a woman,

02:56.340 --> 02:58.540
and women should have womanly virtues.

02:59.560 --> 03:01.150
Since you're engaged,

03:01.280 --> 03:02.400
you should

03:02.400 --> 03:03.550
stay at home,

03:03.680 --> 03:04.630
do some embroidery,

03:04.630 --> 03:06.080
and read a book or two.

03:08.680 --> 03:10.590
You dressed to the nines

03:11.000 --> 03:13.060
for the fancy banquet in the capital.

03:13.440 --> 03:16.240
You just wanted
to attract attention, didn't you?

03:18.240 --> 03:19.970
Not everything that goes wrong

03:20.410 --> 03:22.280
is a woman's fault.

03:24.740 --> 03:25.870
What a sharp tongue!

03:29.360 --> 03:31.680
Today, two princes drew swords
against each other

03:31.680 --> 03:33.280
all because of you.

03:33.840 --> 03:35.120
Everyone saw it,

03:35.150 --> 03:37.079
and you're still trying to deny it.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.560
Are you trying to start

03:39.579 --> 03:41.560
a war between the two princes?

03:45.240 --> 03:46.030
Take her away

03:46.030 --> 03:47.360
and give her 20 strokes.

03:49.190 --> 03:50.000
Your Majesty.

03:50.079 --> 03:50.840
Your Majesty!

03:50.840 --> 03:51.560
Hold on!

03:53.720 --> 03:54.740
Your Highness,

03:54.770 --> 03:56.079
what are you doing

03:56.150 --> 03:58.010
barging into the Imperial Study?

04:00.800 --> 04:01.600
Your Majesty,

04:01.820 --> 04:03.170
everything that happened

04:03.170 --> 04:04.800
was entirely my fault.

04:05.240 --> 04:06.030
I knew

04:06.520 --> 04:07.730
she was already engaged,

04:07.730 --> 04:09.060
but I still pursued her.

04:10.190 --> 04:11.950
I was the one
who had those books made

04:11.950 --> 04:13.360
and circulated.

04:13.800 --> 04:14.850
I also begged Mother

04:14.850 --> 04:16.310
to issue a marriage decree

04:16.329 --> 04:17.130
for us.

04:19.360 --> 04:20.870
I didn't set you up.

04:21.060 --> 04:22.770
The marriage decree came from Mother.

04:22.770 --> 04:24.370
What's that got to do with me?

04:26.720 --> 04:29.000
None of this
has anything to do with Miss Song.

04:29.000 --> 04:29.950
Your Majesty,

04:30.190 --> 04:31.650
please punish me instead.

04:32.470 --> 04:33.310
Very well.

04:33.750 --> 04:35.430
In these 28 years,

04:36.070 --> 04:37.560
my seventh son

04:37.730 --> 04:39.000
has never

04:39.000 --> 04:40.140
made a single mistake—

04:40.140 --> 04:41.870
flawless in every way,

04:41.900 --> 04:42.990
not once

04:43.190 --> 04:45.220
giving anyone anything to use against him.

04:45.220 --> 04:48.020
Yet now here you are,
kneeling and admitting guilt

04:48.040 --> 04:50.310
all for the sake of a woman.

04:51.310 --> 04:52.120
Fine.

04:52.690 --> 04:54.120
Then tell me.

04:54.390 --> 04:56.270
Aside from the Song family behind her,

04:56.270 --> 04:58.070
what makes her so special?

05:01.490 --> 05:03.630
Your Majesty,
you loved the late Empress

05:03.630 --> 05:05.890
not because of the Chu family behind her.

05:06.090 --> 05:07.680
How dare you speak out of turn

05:07.680 --> 05:08.920
about the Emperor?

05:09.480 --> 05:10.560
Listen,

05:11.270 --> 05:13.070
her engagement was arranged long ago.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.810
It cannot be changed!

05:15.070 --> 05:16.630
Be it ruler or subject,

05:16.680 --> 05:17.480
in this world,

05:17.480 --> 05:19.420
everyone must follow the rules.

05:19.510 --> 05:20.830
I wouldn't dare to break the rules.

05:20.830 --> 05:21.950
You wouldn't dare?

05:22.240 --> 05:23.950
You drew your sword against Rui

05:23.950 --> 05:25.510
at the musical banquet.

05:25.560 --> 05:27.420
How was that following the rules?

05:34.140 --> 05:35.230
It was because

05:35.260 --> 05:36.430
he insulted the Gao family

05:36.430 --> 05:37.590
and my mother.

05:37.620 --> 05:38.800
The law of Great Jing makes it clear:

05:38.800 --> 05:40.120
those who turn on their own kin

05:40.120 --> 05:41.980
must be imprisoned and executed.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.120
But today,

05:47.580 --> 05:48.700
I won't kill you.

05:49.850 --> 05:52.380
The hand you used

05:53.310 --> 05:54.600
to dislocate Rui's arm—

05:54.600 --> 05:55.950
cut it off.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.510
What?

06:09.490 --> 06:10.720
You want to

06:10.720 --> 06:12.040
defy my order?

06:18.490 --> 06:20.610
This is treason!

06:32.530 --> 06:33.420
Your Majesty,

06:35.240 --> 06:36.290
everything that happened today

06:36.290 --> 06:37.540
was my fault.

06:37.800 --> 06:39.930
His Highness had nothing to do with it.

06:40.430 --> 06:41.240
Besides,

06:41.570 --> 06:44.700
the Eighteenth Prince
also wounded the Seventh Prince.

06:52.920 --> 06:53.920
What's this?

06:54.510 --> 06:55.830
You're a prince,

06:56.620 --> 06:58.400
and now you're scared

06:59.070 --> 07:01.870
and need a woman to plead for you?

07:12.920 --> 07:13.720
Your Majesty,

07:14.970 --> 07:15.960
as you wish.

07:20.920 --> 07:21.820
Your Highness.

07:24.840 --> 07:28.390
[Exceptional Love]

07:31.750 --> 07:32.690
Your Highness!

07:55.100 --> 07:56.520
No, Your Highness!

08:09.240 --> 08:10.820
I was just joking.

08:11.490 --> 08:12.890
Why take it so seriously?

08:22.390 --> 08:24.850
Or do you want the whole world

08:24.950 --> 08:27.850
to call me a cruel tyrant
who maimed his own son?

08:34.720 --> 08:35.510
I…

08:36.120 --> 08:37.049
I wouldn't dare.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.520
Your Majesty.

08:42.909 --> 08:43.919
Your Majesty,

08:43.950 --> 08:46.130
the Noble Consort fainted in her chambers.

08:46.130 --> 08:47.560
She's delirious

08:47.600 --> 08:48.960
and keeps calling for

08:48.960 --> 08:51.390
the Seventh Prince and Miss Song.

09:03.720 --> 09:04.520
Your Majesty,

09:05.360 --> 09:06.630
I'll answer for this another day

09:06.630 --> 09:09.090
and accept
whatever punishment you see fit.

09:09.120 --> 09:09.870
But now,

09:09.910 --> 09:11.810
my mother has suddenly collapsed.

09:11.810 --> 09:13.070
Please, Your Majesty,

09:13.390 --> 09:14.720
let me go to her.

09:17.460 --> 09:18.110
Get lost.

09:20.440 --> 09:21.840
Thank you, Your Majesty.

09:25.270 --> 09:26.470
I shall take my leave.

09:32.270 --> 09:33.000
Your Highness,

09:33.000 --> 09:34.360
please go and see her.

09:34.750 --> 09:35.320
Mother!

09:35.320 --> 09:36.420
Your Highness.

09:37.270 --> 09:38.120
Mother!

09:43.250 --> 09:44.240
What's this?

09:55.030 --> 09:56.800
Her Ladyship said

09:56.830 --> 09:59.730
Your Highness and Miss Song
should go to bed.

10:03.280 --> 10:04.370
Open the door!

10:06.180 --> 10:07.230
My Lady,

10:08.270 --> 10:09.150
how did it go?

10:09.390 --> 10:10.340
My Lady,

10:10.750 --> 10:12.320
they didn't let go

10:12.390 --> 10:15.250
of each other's hands the whole way.

10:18.250 --> 10:19.370
Heng.

10:19.630 --> 10:20.440
I've done

10:20.440 --> 10:21.960
all I can for you.

10:21.980 --> 10:23.020
The rest

10:23.150 --> 10:25.050
is up to you.

10:32.720 --> 10:33.510
Master.

10:33.550 --> 10:34.120
Where is she?

10:34.120 --> 10:35.630
The palace attendants said

10:35.630 --> 10:37.080
Her Ladyship summoned Miss Song

10:37.080 --> 10:37.910
midway.

10:39.730 --> 10:40.670
Then send someone

10:40.670 --> 10:42.670
to inquire
at Noble Consort Gao's place.

10:42.670 --> 10:44.030
I did.

10:44.060 --> 10:45.590
The maids there said

10:45.720 --> 10:46.910
Miss Song had already left the palace

10:46.910 --> 10:47.910
and gone home.

10:48.200 --> 10:49.000
Master,

10:49.150 --> 10:50.280
that's impossible.

10:50.390 --> 10:51.480
If she had really gone home,

10:51.480 --> 10:53.120
Zhixia would've sent word.

10:53.120 --> 10:53.910
She…

10:53.910 --> 10:54.440
she…

10:54.440 --> 10:56.080
she must still be in the palace.

10:56.080 --> 10:57.600
Something must've happened.

10:57.600 --> 10:58.880
Don't panic.

10:59.150 --> 11:01.920
No one enters the palace
at night unless summoned.

11:01.920 --> 11:03.250
Let's wait a bit longer.

11:17.720 --> 11:18.720
Just as I thought.

11:24.630 --> 11:26.030
Don't waste your energy.

11:26.030 --> 11:27.630
This is Her Ladyship's plan.

11:29.250 --> 11:30.350
What do you mean?

11:31.600 --> 11:32.910
A classic costume-drama scene.

11:32.910 --> 11:33.720
The male and female leads

11:33.720 --> 11:34.910
end up stuck in a room,

11:34.910 --> 11:35.910
forced to bond.

11:36.510 --> 11:38.200
Since Her Ladyship came up with this idea,

11:38.200 --> 11:39.320
there's no way

11:39.320 --> 11:41.240
we're getting out of here tonight.

11:41.240 --> 11:42.440
How do you know that?

11:42.440 --> 11:43.670
Of course I know.

11:43.960 --> 11:45.160
It's a classic scene.

11:45.240 --> 11:46.240
I've played it out

11:46.240 --> 11:47.770
more times than I can count.

11:48.510 --> 11:49.440
You know what?

11:49.440 --> 11:51.170
We might as well just go with it.

11:52.480 --> 11:53.000
Wait.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.130
You're a young lady…

11:55.720 --> 11:56.910
alone in a room with a man.

11:56.910 --> 11:59.040
Shouldn't you behave with propriety?

12:00.080 --> 12:00.870
I…

12:00.870 --> 12:01.960
It's too tight.

12:02.150 --> 12:04.030
What's wrong with
making myself more comfortable?

12:04.030 --> 12:05.150
Why are you so nervous?

12:05.150 --> 12:05.910
I...

12:12.270 --> 12:13.390
You didn't seem this nervous

12:13.390 --> 12:14.910
when you spread the rumors.

12:14.910 --> 12:17.230
Now you're afraid
I'll take advantage of you?

12:17.230 --> 12:18.430
Why would I be afraid?

12:18.480 --> 12:21.080
What do I even have
for you to take advantage of?

12:25.990 --> 12:28.210
Then explain this—

12:29.130 --> 12:32.000
what was that marriage decree
from Her Ladyship all about?

12:32.000 --> 12:33.440
And just now, in front of the Emperor,

12:33.440 --> 12:35.030
you took all the blame for me.

12:35.030 --> 12:36.760
What was that supposed to mean?

12:36.910 --> 12:37.670
Also,

12:38.440 --> 12:39.640
I really want to know—

12:40.480 --> 12:42.960
if His Majesty
hadn't stopped you just now,

12:43.870 --> 12:46.070
would you really have cut off your hand?

12:51.630 --> 12:52.770
I was just gambling,

12:54.150 --> 12:55.460
like I've been doing

12:55.550 --> 12:56.720
all my life.

12:57.960 --> 12:59.890
Gambling that if I obey and behave,

13:00.080 --> 13:01.720
I'll be let off one more time.

13:10.790 --> 13:11.600
Well then.

13:12.790 --> 13:13.910
Looks like

13:14.610 --> 13:16.860
the fake couple in "Exceptional Love"

13:17.100 --> 13:19.340
has made its way to the Emperor.

13:21.080 --> 13:22.790
I gotta say, you're pretty bold,

13:22.790 --> 13:24.910
daring to touch the Emperor's sore spot.

13:24.910 --> 13:25.720
I've already told you,

13:25.720 --> 13:27.580
this whole thing wasn't my doing.

13:27.630 --> 13:28.910
You think I'm dumb enough

13:28.910 --> 13:30.630
to risk being accused of treason

13:30.630 --> 13:31.720
just to…

13:32.140 --> 13:33.800
to play a fake couple with you?

13:33.870 --> 13:35.200
Are you out of your mind?

13:40.120 --> 13:42.430
That does sound absurd.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.120
Fair point.

13:44.690 --> 13:46.230
So you saved me

13:46.400 --> 13:48.020
just because of...

13:54.000 --> 13:55.240
Don't think I don't know

13:55.240 --> 13:56.550
why you helped me.

13:57.550 --> 13:58.950
You're overthinking it.

13:59.000 --> 14:00.100
I helped you

14:00.270 --> 14:01.080
only because of

14:01.080 --> 14:02.670
the rules you mentioned.

14:05.520 --> 14:06.750
The rule that when the female lead

14:06.750 --> 14:09.010
is in danger, the male lead must save her.

14:17.960 --> 14:20.060
Miss Song, you're really clever.

14:24.400 --> 14:25.440
Brilliant, even.

14:31.240 --> 14:32.030
You…

14:32.030 --> 14:33.090
What are you doing?

14:34.080 --> 14:35.100
What do you think I'm doing?

14:35.100 --> 14:35.870
Going to sleep.

14:35.870 --> 14:36.550
It's already 10 PM.

14:36.550 --> 14:38.280
You want me to stay up all night?

14:38.390 --> 14:40.790
Does a workaholic
like you even need sleep?

14:41.080 --> 14:41.870
Even the King of Hell

14:41.870 --> 14:43.270
has to sleep.

14:43.630 --> 14:44.840
But this place is so big.

14:44.840 --> 14:45.720
Why do you have to

14:45.720 --> 14:46.930
sleep on the bed?

14:47.030 --> 14:47.720
Well, if not here,

14:47.720 --> 14:48.670
am I s-supposed to

14:48.670 --> 14:49.730
sleep on the floor?

14:49.790 --> 14:50.600
But if you sleep here,

14:50.600 --> 14:51.440
where am I supposed to sleep?

14:51.440 --> 14:52.910
Wherever you want.

14:53.600 --> 14:55.030
Didn't you just tell me

14:55.670 --> 14:56.560
to go with

14:56.870 --> 14:57.910
the flow?

15:02.910 --> 15:03.720
You…

15:06.580 --> 15:11.340
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

15:08.550 --> 15:09.550
Guard the mansion.

15:09.550 --> 15:11.350
I'll go bring His Highness back!

15:15.360 --> 15:17.930
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

15:18.360 --> 15:18.960
General Chu.

15:18.960 --> 15:20.020
Guard the mansion.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.540
I'll go bring Yimeng back.

15:23.960 --> 15:26.480
[Qianyu Mansion]

15:26.550 --> 15:27.910
You all head back first.

15:26.650 --> 15:29.420
[Guangde Gate]

15:27.930 --> 15:29.480
I'll go bring Yimeng back.

15:35.290 --> 15:37.390
[Xumian Hall]

15:47.270 --> 15:49.850
Why is it getting
colder and colder in here?

16:22.630 --> 16:23.240
Let…

16:23.240 --> 16:24.110
Let go of me!

16:24.200 --> 16:25.000
Let go of me!

16:25.000 --> 16:25.960
Get off me!

16:31.080 --> 16:31.870
Forget it.

16:32.030 --> 16:33.240
I'd rather freeze to death

16:33.240 --> 16:34.360
than deal with him.

16:34.630 --> 16:36.360
In a sweet romance script like this,

16:36.360 --> 16:37.870
you've got to tread carefully.

16:37.870 --> 16:38.960
One wrong move,

16:39.030 --> 16:41.290
and you'll fall right into a cliché plot.

16:53.820 --> 16:56.110
None of this
has anything to do with Miss Song.

16:56.110 --> 16:57.370
Please, Your Majesty,

16:57.400 --> 16:58.460
punish me instead.

16:58.790 --> 16:59.600
Fine.

17:00.270 --> 17:01.510
Then tell me,

17:01.730 --> 17:03.750
apart from the Song family behind her,

17:03.750 --> 17:05.510
what makes her so special?

17:07.369 --> 17:09.530
Your Majesty,
you loved the late Empress

17:09.530 --> 17:11.790
not because of the Chu family behind her.

17:30.000 --> 17:30.790
You…

17:31.670 --> 17:33.000
You can't sleep either?

17:35.070 --> 17:37.200
Not with all that noise you're making.

17:39.000 --> 17:39.790
I…

17:43.070 --> 17:44.000
What do you want?

17:51.680 --> 17:52.810
Apply the ointment.

17:55.720 --> 17:56.590
For you?

17:56.720 --> 17:58.030
The wound is on your back.

17:58.030 --> 17:59.490
Isn't that a bit improper?

18:00.550 --> 18:02.920
I took care of my wound
as soon as I left Waning River Crescent.

18:02.920 --> 18:03.680
It's for you.

18:10.000 --> 18:12.060
So you do have a conscience after all.

18:18.700 --> 18:20.240
Song Yimeng,

18:20.340 --> 18:22.000
do you have to be so frivolous?

18:25.640 --> 18:26.640
What's wrong?

18:26.670 --> 18:27.560
Your Highness,

18:28.590 --> 18:30.270
didn't you just say

18:30.720 --> 18:32.550
you weren't afraid
I'd take advantage of you?

18:32.550 --> 18:34.620
Now you're afraid?

18:49.270 --> 18:50.480
Weird.

18:51.050 --> 18:52.490
Where did you

18:52.680 --> 18:53.740
get this ointment?

18:56.070 --> 18:57.470
I bought it on the street.

18:59.070 --> 19:00.590
Your Highness,

19:01.030 --> 19:03.430
you went to
Waning River Crescent to buy it?

19:04.680 --> 19:05.750
So what?

19:13.590 --> 19:14.400
By the way,

19:14.920 --> 19:16.310
let me ask you something.

19:16.310 --> 19:18.170
Isn't the annual musical banquet

19:18.200 --> 19:19.200
usually held

19:19.270 --> 19:21.330
in the bamboo grove outside the city?

19:21.640 --> 19:24.440
Why was it held
at Waning River Crescent this year?

19:28.600 --> 19:30.130
Are you planning something

19:30.280 --> 19:32.200
against Waning River Crescent?

19:35.830 --> 19:37.300
I'm a prince.

19:37.400 --> 19:39.930
Why would I be bothered
by a bunch of nobodies?

19:40.880 --> 19:41.880
But you—

19:43.770 --> 19:46.050
you've gotten so close
to that martial-world guy—

19:46.050 --> 19:47.280
Li Shiliu.

19:51.110 --> 19:52.210
Don't tell me

19:52.960 --> 19:54.590
you've got a thing for him.

19:55.270 --> 19:55.880
I...

19:59.610 --> 20:01.760
Are you kidding me?

20:01.780 --> 20:03.270
He's from the martial world.

20:03.270 --> 20:05.330
I'd never fall for someone like that.

20:07.880 --> 20:09.080
Why are you blushing?

20:09.610 --> 20:10.530
I…

20:11.090 --> 20:12.730
I'm not blushing at all.

20:12.790 --> 20:14.550
You're mistaken.

20:14.550 --> 20:15.400
Look at you—

20:15.510 --> 20:16.230
you're stammering.

20:16.230 --> 20:17.310
All flustered.

20:17.590 --> 20:19.320
It's obvious that you like him.

20:23.670 --> 20:24.560
I know.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.850
You're just trying to trick me into

20:26.920 --> 20:28.830
telling you who I like, aren't you?

20:28.830 --> 20:29.960
Let me be clear.

20:29.980 --> 20:31.680
There is no way I'll marry you.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.880
No matter how many
betrothal gifts your mother sends,

20:33.880 --> 20:35.350
no matter what tricks you pull,

20:35.350 --> 20:36.200
it's never happening.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.030
Got it?

20:37.310 --> 20:38.440
I told you already.

20:38.720 --> 20:39.790
That was all my mother's doing.

20:39.790 --> 20:41.120
I knew nothing about it.

20:41.160 --> 20:41.920
Don't tell me you think

20:41.920 --> 20:43.720
I arranged for us to be stuck here

20:43.720 --> 20:45.000
together tonight.

20:46.210 --> 20:47.750
Well, who knows?

20:50.860 --> 20:51.680
I knew it.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.920
You're impossible

20:52.920 --> 20:53.890
to reason with.

20:55.310 --> 20:55.920
Excuse me?

20:55.920 --> 20:56.960
What do you mean?

20:56.980 --> 20:57.920
Me? Unreasonable?

20:57.920 --> 20:58.920
Make it clear.

20:59.590 --> 21:01.440
I'm saying you're unreasonable.

21:01.440 --> 21:03.240
I've helped you again and again,

21:03.400 --> 21:05.270
never once asking for anything in return.

21:05.270 --> 21:06.070
At the musical banquet,

21:06.070 --> 21:07.350
I stepped in to help you,

21:07.350 --> 21:08.310
and what did I get?

21:08.310 --> 21:09.830
You teamed up with Chu Guihong

21:09.830 --> 21:11.090
and turned against me.

21:11.270 --> 21:12.350
I didn't plan to hold it against you.

21:12.350 --> 21:13.550
What more do you want?

21:16.880 --> 21:17.160
I...

21:17.160 --> 21:18.070
You what?

21:18.070 --> 21:18.720
Say it!

21:18.720 --> 21:19.920
What more do you want?

21:22.680 --> 21:24.680
Now you're the one feeling wronged?

21:25.830 --> 21:26.510
What?

21:27.290 --> 21:28.530
Can't I feel wronged?

21:28.960 --> 21:30.360
Of course I feel wronged.

21:30.670 --> 21:32.920
That ridiculous musical banquet.

21:33.000 --> 21:33.510
I said

21:33.510 --> 21:35.350
I wasn't going; I said it over and over,

21:35.350 --> 21:36.950
but my father forced me to go.

21:38.130 --> 21:39.460
Fine, I went.

21:39.840 --> 21:41.400
But what did you do there?

21:41.720 --> 21:43.340
You talked nonsense

21:43.360 --> 21:44.710
in front of everyone.

21:44.750 --> 21:45.830
Did you consider my feelings?

21:45.830 --> 21:46.750
Did you?

21:48.120 --> 21:49.290
And your father!

21:49.570 --> 21:52.750
You were the one arguing
and fighting with the Eighteenth Prince.

21:52.750 --> 21:54.640
Why was I the one
who had to kneel all night?

21:54.640 --> 21:55.200
You know what?

21:55.200 --> 21:56.350
My knees are red now.

21:56.350 --> 21:57.510
Red and swollen,

21:57.510 --> 21:58.570
hurting like hell.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.960
It's not just my knees.

21:59.960 --> 22:01.200
My whole body aches.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.640
I'm also cold and hungry.

22:03.310 --> 22:04.910
What did I do to deserve this?

22:05.700 --> 22:08.100
The more I think about it,
the angrier I get.

22:12.750 --> 22:13.550
Fine.

22:14.680 --> 22:15.680
It's all my fault.

22:16.200 --> 22:17.000
I'm sorry.

22:23.340 --> 22:25.130
Is that how you apologize?

22:25.200 --> 22:26.660
You're not sincere at all.

22:26.720 --> 22:28.120
Come on, don't push your…

22:36.590 --> 22:37.400
Sorry.

22:38.820 --> 22:41.000
I shouldn't have dragged you into this.

22:41.000 --> 22:43.400
I shouldn't have pulled you into politics.

22:43.440 --> 22:44.370
I shouldn't have

22:44.430 --> 22:46.230
let you face others' criticism.

22:46.560 --> 22:48.320
I didn't handle it well.

22:49.010 --> 22:50.230
But from now on,

22:51.390 --> 22:53.250
I won't let anyone hurt you again.

23:00.790 --> 23:01.590
Now,

23:02.640 --> 23:03.440
go sleep

23:03.890 --> 23:04.860
on the bed.

23:05.680 --> 23:06.610
I'll sleep here.

23:08.200 --> 23:09.930
But if you dare wake me up again,

23:12.020 --> 23:13.200
I'll kill you.

23:55.460 --> 24:03.830
[Xumian Hall]

24:48.830 --> 24:49.720
Fugui?

24:49.790 --> 24:50.650
Your Highness!

24:53.510 --> 24:54.220
Why are you…

24:58.310 --> 24:59.200
Your Highness,

24:59.310 --> 25:00.640
I searched for you all night.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.790
I was worried sick.

25:01.830 --> 25:03.550
I thought something
had happened to you.

25:03.550 --> 25:04.070
Your Highness!

25:04.070 --> 25:04.310
Wait,

25:04.310 --> 25:05.970
what on earth are you wearing?

25:07.300 --> 25:09.020
I willingly ruined my image

25:09.040 --> 25:11.030
just to be reunited with you!

25:12.070 --> 25:13.000
What did I do

25:13.000 --> 25:13.510
to be reunited

25:13.510 --> 25:15.070
with a bearded maid like you?

25:15.070 --> 25:15.920
I can't believe this.

25:15.920 --> 25:17.040
Get up now.

25:17.310 --> 25:18.880
Entering the palace
without permission is a crime.

25:18.880 --> 25:20.270
Dressing up as a maid
only makes it worse.

25:20.270 --> 25:20.590
I...

25:20.590 --> 25:21.720
Let's talk outside.

25:22.240 --> 25:22.750
Yimeng.

25:23.830 --> 25:24.460
Yimeng.

25:25.720 --> 25:26.280
Yimeng.

25:26.310 --> 25:27.600
C-Chu Guihong?

25:28.110 --> 25:28.720
Go, go, go.

25:28.720 --> 25:29.400
Get in.

25:29.480 --> 25:30.160
Get in.

25:33.510 --> 25:34.310
Chu Guihong.

25:34.310 --> 25:35.030
Yimeng,

25:35.070 --> 25:35.920
are you okay?

25:35.960 --> 25:36.790
Why are you…

25:41.960 --> 25:42.790
Nan Heng.

25:44.590 --> 25:46.110
You spent the night alone with her.

25:46.110 --> 25:48.180
Don't you think you need to explain it?

25:48.180 --> 25:50.240
Why should I explain anything to you?

25:50.480 --> 25:51.200
You…

25:52.510 --> 25:53.310
Alright, alright,

25:53.310 --> 25:53.640
enough.

25:53.640 --> 25:54.790
Stop fighting.

25:55.640 --> 25:57.900
You want to attract even more attention?

25:58.200 --> 25:59.000
Chu Guihong,

25:59.000 --> 25:59.920
you need to leave.

25:59.920 --> 26:01.400
If someone finds you here,
there'll be serious trouble.

26:01.400 --> 26:01.880
He...

26:02.070 --> 26:02.790
Yimeng.

26:03.270 --> 26:04.070
Yimeng.

26:05.070 --> 26:06.000
Yimeng.

26:06.440 --> 26:07.200
My father?

26:07.200 --> 26:07.830
Yimeng.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.640
Oh no.

26:08.640 --> 26:09.680
If my father sees us like this,

26:09.680 --> 26:11.480
he'll definitely get the wrong idea.

26:11.480 --> 26:12.160
Come on,

26:12.160 --> 26:12.960
you need to hide.

26:12.960 --> 26:13.480
Hide.

26:13.480 --> 26:14.350
Don't make this harder for me.

26:14.350 --> 26:15.610
Stay hidden, alright?

26:19.920 --> 26:20.720
You…

26:22.000 --> 26:23.130
We all snuck in without permission,

26:23.130 --> 26:24.530
so no one rats anyone out.

26:25.720 --> 26:26.520
A palace maid,

26:26.530 --> 26:27.330
a guard…

26:27.830 --> 26:28.590
Throw in a eunuch,

26:28.590 --> 26:30.120
and we've got a full lineup.

26:35.070 --> 26:36.170
Yimeng.

26:36.740 --> 26:37.550
Father.

26:37.550 --> 26:38.110
Yimeng.

26:38.110 --> 26:38.350
Father.

26:38.350 --> 26:40.000
Why are you here too?

26:40.000 --> 26:40.640
And why

26:40.680 --> 26:42.270
are you dressed like this?

26:45.000 --> 26:45.790
I thought I just

26:45.790 --> 26:47.720
heard the Seventh Prince's voice.

26:48.290 --> 26:49.500
Is he here too?

26:51.270 --> 26:51.920
No,

26:51.920 --> 26:53.520
I'm the only one in this room.

26:58.680 --> 27:02.140
You didn't leave the palace all night.

27:02.170 --> 27:03.880
Did something happen?

27:07.270 --> 27:08.650
Did someone plot against you,

27:08.650 --> 27:09.510
set you up,

27:09.510 --> 27:10.640
and lock you in here?

27:11.680 --> 27:12.830
N-No.

27:12.830 --> 27:13.780
It was Nan Heng?

27:15.030 --> 27:17.160
That scheming snake.

27:17.240 --> 27:18.240
It has to be him!

27:18.400 --> 27:19.200
Stop.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.750
L-Let's not stay here.

27:24.750 --> 27:25.160
Come on,

27:25.160 --> 27:25.640
let's go home.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.900
His Majesty is here!

27:28.240 --> 27:29.160
Crap.

27:29.180 --> 27:30.660
Why is His Majesty here?

27:30.920 --> 27:31.920
Seal off the whole place.

27:31.920 --> 27:33.030
No one is allowed near.

27:33.030 --> 27:33.680
Yes.

27:34.510 --> 27:35.200
We're done for.

27:35.200 --> 27:35.750
Yimeng.

27:35.830 --> 27:36.590
Yimeng,

27:36.830 --> 27:38.240
go chat with His Majesty for a bit.

27:38.240 --> 27:39.650
I need to hide.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.670
Father, no, no!

27:41.750 --> 27:42.820
Don't go in there!

27:42.880 --> 27:44.050
Don't go in there!

27:45.830 --> 27:46.640
You…

27:46.830 --> 27:47.310
You…

27:47.770 --> 27:48.650
Mr. Song,

27:49.030 --> 27:50.490
you're welcome to join us.

27:56.590 --> 27:57.650
It's so screwed up.

27:59.720 --> 28:00.550
Song Yimeng!

28:02.070 --> 28:02.880
Your Majesty,

28:03.830 --> 28:04.790
what a surprise.

28:04.810 --> 28:06.100
You're here too.

28:06.240 --> 28:07.270
How dare you

28:07.480 --> 28:09.540
not kneel at the sight of His Majesty?

28:09.590 --> 28:10.400
Guards!

28:10.400 --> 28:11.200
Wait.

28:11.240 --> 28:11.890
Don't call the guards.

28:11.890 --> 28:12.640
Please don't.

28:12.640 --> 28:13.400
I'll kneel,

28:13.960 --> 28:14.750
I'll kneel.

28:16.070 --> 28:17.070
Don't kneel!

28:19.590 --> 28:20.310
Your Highness.

28:20.310 --> 28:21.160
It's Her Ladyship.

28:21.160 --> 28:21.830
She...

28:23.240 --> 28:24.370
Greetings, My Lady.

28:26.110 --> 28:27.200
What did you say?

28:29.030 --> 28:30.400
I asked her not to kneel.

28:31.350 --> 28:33.790
Song Yimeng is my daughter-in-law.

28:34.240 --> 28:36.460
I won't let anyone bully her.

28:36.800 --> 28:38.610
Daughter-in-law?

28:41.580 --> 28:42.640
Ridiculous!

28:43.600 --> 28:46.160
She's been engaged
to Chu Guihong since childhood.

28:46.160 --> 28:48.510
I personally approved that match

28:48.510 --> 28:50.220
when Lord Qianyu was still alive.

28:50.220 --> 28:51.560
Noble Consort,

28:51.780 --> 28:54.410
are you ignoring my promise?

28:54.920 --> 28:57.070
Back then,
my engagement to Prince Pingyang

28:57.070 --> 28:59.000
was arranged by the late Emperor.

28:59.000 --> 29:00.310
But once Your Majesty took the throne,

29:00.310 --> 29:02.310
you threw all that aside
and brought me into the palace

29:02.310 --> 29:03.070
just to get heirs

29:03.070 --> 29:04.870
and keep the Gao family in check.

29:05.030 --> 29:05.750
If you could break

29:05.750 --> 29:07.960
the late Emperor's promise,

29:08.310 --> 29:10.110
why can't I break yours

29:10.110 --> 29:11.680
for Heng's sake?

29:11.680 --> 29:13.890
How can you compare the two situations?

29:14.110 --> 29:15.200
Why not?

29:15.830 --> 29:17.970
You ruined my life

29:18.030 --> 29:19.690
for your own selfish desires.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.760
And now,

29:21.070 --> 29:22.880
you want to ruin Heng's life too.

29:23.510 --> 29:24.640
I won't allow it!

29:24.920 --> 29:25.920
Wasn't she

29:25.920 --> 29:27.910
a gentle, weak consort in the script?

29:27.910 --> 29:29.680
Why has she suddenly
changed so much?

29:29.680 --> 29:30.310
Are you insane,

29:30.310 --> 29:31.170
Gao Changrong?

29:31.830 --> 29:33.830
How dare you speak to me like this

29:33.830 --> 29:35.640
for a girl from the Song family?

29:38.200 --> 29:39.200
I've wanted

29:39.880 --> 29:41.550
to say this for a long time.

29:44.310 --> 29:46.000
I've held back for decades.

29:46.840 --> 29:48.020
All I've ever wanted

29:48.200 --> 29:50.380
is for Heng to be safe and happy.

29:51.320 --> 29:52.600
But what about you?

29:53.400 --> 29:54.690
What have you done?

29:55.490 --> 29:57.530
Shall I list every injustice

29:57.890 --> 29:59.130
Heng has suffered,

29:59.160 --> 30:01.110
right here in front of Miss Song?

30:04.550 --> 30:05.350
Fine.

30:06.330 --> 30:08.200
Since you've made up your mind,

30:08.240 --> 30:09.110
don't blame me for…

30:09.110 --> 30:10.070
What will you do?

30:11.070 --> 30:12.580
The Gao family and I

30:13.210 --> 30:15.060
are determined to make

30:15.200 --> 30:16.400
Miss Song our family.

30:30.880 --> 30:32.280
Farewell, Your Majesty.

30:39.310 --> 30:40.650
Gao Changrong

30:41.070 --> 30:42.720
has been my consort for over 30 years,

30:42.720 --> 30:44.620
always quiet as a mouse.

30:44.920 --> 30:46.750
But look at her now!

30:50.920 --> 30:52.720
Your Majesty, please calm down.

30:56.880 --> 30:57.680
Your Majesty,

30:57.680 --> 30:58.720
Mr. Song is here.

31:03.590 --> 31:04.400
Let him in.

31:05.520 --> 31:06.350
Mr. Song.

31:13.920 --> 31:14.880
Your Majesty.

31:16.550 --> 31:17.510
You old fox,

31:17.510 --> 31:18.770
what brought you here?

31:19.960 --> 31:21.310
I'm exhausted today.

31:21.550 --> 31:23.610
I don't have time for your mind games.

31:25.110 --> 31:26.720
The medical texts say

31:26.720 --> 31:28.880
fatigue stems from blocked qi.

31:29.270 --> 31:31.550
Your Majesty,
you're troubled and stressed.

31:31.550 --> 31:33.540
Of course you feel tired.

31:34.480 --> 31:35.860
I've come today

31:35.880 --> 31:38.470
to bring you a miraculous remedy.

31:38.770 --> 31:39.750
My Lady,

31:40.240 --> 31:42.550
I thought you died in the palace.

31:42.830 --> 31:44.480
If you had died,

31:44.480 --> 31:46.030
I wouldn't go on living.

31:46.030 --> 31:46.750
My Lady,

31:46.750 --> 31:47.960
I'll serve you

31:47.960 --> 31:49.400
in this life and the next.

31:49.830 --> 31:51.380
Alright, alright.

31:51.550 --> 31:53.590
You've been crying all day.

31:53.590 --> 31:54.590
Yingqiu.

31:54.790 --> 31:55.700
Come on.

31:55.790 --> 31:57.730
Aren't I alive and well?

31:57.880 --> 31:59.240
If you keep crying like this,

31:59.240 --> 32:01.300
people will think I'm actually dead.

32:01.960 --> 32:02.750
My Lady,

32:03.320 --> 32:05.110
the Seventh Prince used to stir up rumors

32:05.110 --> 32:08.200
even when nothing happened
between you two.

32:08.200 --> 32:10.200
And now that you two spent
the whole night alone in a room,

32:10.200 --> 32:11.880
he's suddenly gone all quiet?

32:17.970 --> 32:20.370
I just don't believe that a bad guy

32:20.400 --> 32:22.140
can suddenly turn good.

32:22.920 --> 32:24.480
With insight like that,

32:25.000 --> 32:26.860
saving you was worth it after all.

32:32.640 --> 32:33.310
Here,

32:33.310 --> 32:34.160
try this.

32:34.240 --> 32:36.500
It's brewed with mountain spring water.

32:36.750 --> 32:37.830
Thank you.

32:48.270 --> 32:49.680
Sit up straight.

32:50.110 --> 32:51.200
Eyes forward.

32:52.610 --> 32:53.960
Use three fingers

32:54.350 --> 32:55.750
to hold the cup steadily.

32:56.240 --> 32:57.300
Observe the color.

32:58.070 --> 32:59.000
Smell the aroma.

32:59.790 --> 33:00.590
Taste the tea.

33:01.070 --> 33:03.510
Let the flavor
sit on your tongue for a bit.

33:03.640 --> 33:05.030
Don't gulp it down.

33:05.550 --> 33:06.830
It ruins the good tea.

33:09.480 --> 33:10.550
You heard me.

33:10.720 --> 33:12.240
You know nothing about music, art,

33:12.240 --> 33:13.680
poetry, or etiquette.

33:13.920 --> 33:15.160
If you go out as my elder sister,

33:15.160 --> 33:17.020
I'll definitely be embarrassed.

33:20.290 --> 33:21.320
Song Yiting,

33:21.530 --> 33:23.250
if I've offended you somehow,

33:23.400 --> 33:25.200
you could just tell me.

33:25.310 --> 33:27.910
Why are you suddenly
talking about etiquette?

33:29.270 --> 33:30.940
Look at you—

33:31.030 --> 33:32.680
shaking over one cup of tea.

33:33.270 --> 33:34.560
Then yesterday,

33:34.590 --> 33:35.920
at the musical banquet,

33:36.030 --> 33:37.480
how did you have the courage

33:37.480 --> 33:39.160
to say such bold things?

33:40.490 --> 33:41.420
What did I say?

33:43.020 --> 33:45.200
"Exceptional Love"

33:45.200 --> 33:46.200
and "Illusory Dream"

33:46.200 --> 33:47.720
are just made-up nonsense!

33:47.720 --> 33:48.750
I'm telling you,

33:48.750 --> 33:50.070
if anyone dares gossip

33:50.070 --> 33:51.510
about me behind my back again,

33:51.510 --> 33:53.030
I won't go easy on them.

33:54.350 --> 33:55.640
I used to think

33:55.720 --> 33:57.350
you were just like everyone else

33:57.350 --> 33:58.640
in the capital,

33:59.160 --> 34:00.680
dreaming of

34:00.680 --> 34:02.080
marrying a powerful man.

34:02.590 --> 34:04.240
But yesterday, I realized

34:04.750 --> 34:05.680
you're actually

34:05.830 --> 34:06.880
not bad.

34:08.920 --> 34:10.070
So today,

34:10.070 --> 34:11.590
I came to warn you.

34:12.110 --> 34:13.880
As soon as Father
returned from the palace,

34:13.880 --> 34:15.940
he told Mother to prepare your dowry.

34:15.940 --> 34:17.670
He said His Majesty gave the order—

34:17.670 --> 34:19.320
you're getting married next month.

34:19.320 --> 34:20.280
What?

34:20.520 --> 34:21.820
Next month?

34:22.360 --> 34:24.389
[Qianyu Mansion]

34:23.190 --> 34:24.480
About our wedding date,

34:24.480 --> 34:26.400
I was planning to talk to you about it,

34:26.400 --> 34:27.730
but you came to me first.

34:27.920 --> 34:29.110
You like kapok flowers.

34:29.110 --> 34:30.310
They bloom in spring,

34:30.510 --> 34:32.400
but that's still a while away.

34:32.670 --> 34:33.670
So I had the Imperial Astronomical Bureau

34:33.670 --> 34:35.070
pick the nearest auspicious date.

34:35.070 --> 34:35.880
I'm sorry.

34:38.150 --> 34:39.540
I didn't understand

34:40.190 --> 34:42.190
my feelings at first.

34:43.310 --> 34:44.850
But now I do.

34:48.969 --> 34:49.989
This

34:50.710 --> 34:52.639
was left to you by the late Empress.

34:54.330 --> 34:55.380
I can't accept it.

34:59.490 --> 35:00.670
If you don't like this jade pendant,

35:00.670 --> 35:01.660
I'll get you something else.

35:01.660 --> 35:04.070
The Eighteenth Prince
just gave me a great piece of jade.

35:04.070 --> 35:05.510
I'll use it to make something

35:05.510 --> 35:06.630
with kapok flower patterns for you.

35:06.630 --> 35:07.070
What do you say?

35:07.070 --> 35:07.920
Chu Guihong.

35:09.150 --> 35:09.960
I...

35:15.950 --> 35:17.480
I don't want to get married.

35:17.670 --> 35:18.510
Don't worry.

35:18.590 --> 35:19.320
All the required gifts

35:19.320 --> 35:20.030
and rituals—

35:20.030 --> 35:20.920
we won't skip anything.

35:20.920 --> 35:21.920
It has nothing to do with that.

35:21.920 --> 35:22.550
Or would you prefer to

35:22.550 --> 35:23.550
have the ceremony somewhere else?

35:23.550 --> 35:23.760
I remember…

35:23.760 --> 35:25.070
I can't marry you!

35:43.510 --> 35:44.110
Yimeng.

35:47.760 --> 35:48.820
We've been engaged

35:48.840 --> 35:49.840
for 18 years.

35:50.890 --> 35:52.190
There were so many times

35:52.190 --> 35:53.320
when I almost died.

35:53.840 --> 35:56.170
What kept me going
was the thought of you waiting

35:56.170 --> 35:57.370
for me in the capital.

35:58.700 --> 36:00.630
If you haven't thought it through,

36:00.670 --> 36:01.610
I can wait.

36:01.710 --> 36:03.640
I've waited so many years already.

36:03.710 --> 36:04.970
However long it takes,

36:05.030 --> 36:06.030
I'll wait for you.

36:11.150 --> 36:12.000
Chu Guihong,

36:12.840 --> 36:14.110
don't wait anymore.

36:17.450 --> 36:19.210
The Song Yimeng you love

36:19.810 --> 36:21.450
isn't me.

36:22.770 --> 36:23.980
Do you understand?

36:25.510 --> 36:27.390
At first, I thought

36:27.510 --> 36:28.480
maybe

36:28.670 --> 36:30.030
we could be together.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.440
But as time passed, I realized

36:32.720 --> 36:34.930
we were not from the same world.

36:37.940 --> 36:40.200
That night during the Lantern Festival,

36:40.400 --> 36:42.480
you did what you thought was right.

36:42.510 --> 36:43.820
And that, more than anything,

36:43.820 --> 36:44.850
proved how wrong

36:45.320 --> 36:46.520
we are for each other.

37:01.100 --> 37:02.680
[To Pingrong, from Song Yimeng,
addressed to Chu Guihong]

37:04.070 --> 37:04.880
These

37:04.920 --> 37:06.780
are all the letters we exchanged.

37:07.710 --> 37:09.800
1,632 of them.

37:11.740 --> 37:13.670
You say the person I love isn't you.

37:14.140 --> 37:15.210
Then who is it?

37:16.110 --> 37:16.920
Tell me.

37:26.590 --> 37:27.400
Yimeng.

37:28.340 --> 37:29.600
This marriage

37:29.700 --> 37:32.160
was decided by both
His Majesty and Mr. Song.

37:32.400 --> 37:33.440
If we go against the imperial edict

37:33.440 --> 37:34.110
and anger the Emperor,

37:34.110 --> 37:35.760
it could cost countless lives.

37:35.760 --> 37:36.550
So

37:37.180 --> 37:39.180
please don't overthink this, okay?

37:41.710 --> 37:42.510
In the future,

37:43.460 --> 37:44.990
I'll treat you really well.

37:47.590 --> 37:48.070
I...

37:52.790 --> 37:53.560
Yimeng!

37:59.190 --> 38:00.800
A gathering of heroes,

38:00.840 --> 38:02.320
talents from everywhere,

38:02.320 --> 38:05.070
and the brightest minds under one roof.

38:05.070 --> 38:06.510
Legendary generals and commanders,

38:06.510 --> 38:08.070
talents emerging one after another,

38:08.070 --> 38:11.280
all marvel at Chief's unmatched presence.

38:15.480 --> 38:16.360
What does that mean?

38:16.360 --> 38:17.110
Explain it.

38:17.330 --> 38:20.280
Something new I picked up from Yao Qian.

38:20.510 --> 38:21.510
You don't like it?

38:21.630 --> 38:22.690
Everyone, get out!

38:22.880 --> 38:23.440
Wait,

38:23.440 --> 38:24.110
Chief.

38:24.440 --> 38:25.190
Yesterday, Chu

38:25.190 --> 38:27.150
and that consort both wanted Miss Song.

38:27.150 --> 38:29.110
We can't just sit around and do nothing.

38:29.110 --> 38:29.880
We're waiting for

38:29.880 --> 38:30.710
your further instructions.

38:30.710 --> 38:31.400
I said get out.

38:31.400 --> 38:32.360
Didn't you hear me?

38:32.360 --> 38:33.070
But…

38:35.720 --> 38:36.510
Get out!

38:42.510 --> 38:43.320
What's wrong?

38:44.030 --> 38:45.360
Who upset you this time?

38:47.460 --> 38:48.880
Go burn every last copy

38:48.880 --> 38:50.200
of "Exceptional Love."

38:50.200 --> 38:51.550
From now on, I don't want to see

38:51.550 --> 38:53.410
a single copy of it in the capital.

38:57.920 --> 38:59.470
What happened?

39:02.030 --> 39:03.680
Chu Guihong was right.

39:03.710 --> 39:05.970
He really does love Song Yimeng.

39:06.000 --> 39:07.040
If we marry,

39:07.320 --> 39:09.840
the original plot will still play out.

39:10.040 --> 39:11.460
But if we break up

39:11.550 --> 39:12.920
and go against the imperial edict,

39:12.920 --> 39:14.320
could something else go wrong?

39:14.320 --> 39:15.760
Whoever solves this riddle

39:15.760 --> 39:17.360
will get 1,000 taels of gold.

39:17.400 --> 39:18.070
What's this?

39:18.070 --> 39:19.030
Take a look.

39:19.320 --> 39:20.450
1,000 teals of gold!

39:22.680 --> 39:24.850
[Clues to decode this message will be
rewarded at Waning River Crescent.]

39:29.510 --> 39:30.440
Keep hammering.

39:30.510 --> 39:31.440
Keep hammering.

39:31.760 --> 39:33.400
Turn your rage into strength.

39:33.400 --> 39:34.670
Keep this up and you might actually

39:34.670 --> 39:36.670
learn the method of weapon forging.

39:37.880 --> 39:39.880
Whether I'd learn it or not, I don't know,

39:39.880 --> 39:41.210
but if you keep talking,

39:41.510 --> 39:43.110
I swear I'll smash your head in

39:43.110 --> 39:44.400
with this hammer.

39:48.110 --> 39:49.800
The wedding is on the 18th of next month.

39:49.800 --> 39:51.960
That's only a few days away.

39:52.110 --> 39:53.310
What do you plan to do?

39:56.480 --> 39:57.230
It's their wedding.

39:57.230 --> 39:58.690
What's it got to do with me?

39:58.840 --> 39:59.550
If you mean that,

39:59.550 --> 40:00.680
why are you so upset?

40:08.110 --> 40:09.000
Am I upset?

40:12.500 --> 40:13.520
Am I upset?

40:15.270 --> 40:16.920
Which eye of yours saw me upset?

40:16.920 --> 40:18.580
Fine, you're not upset at all.

40:19.280 --> 40:20.210
Wipe your sweat.

40:27.950 --> 40:29.150
Actually,

40:29.550 --> 40:31.550
the Emperor is pushing for this marriage

40:31.550 --> 40:33.590
because he's thinking of naming an heir.

40:33.590 --> 40:35.440
If the Song family won't side with you,

40:35.440 --> 40:36.480
just give up

40:36.480 --> 40:37.840
and try something else.

40:37.840 --> 40:38.840
Why should I give up?

40:38.840 --> 40:40.440
Then what are you going to do?

40:40.800 --> 40:42.360
His Majesty has made it clear

40:42.360 --> 40:43.590
that he's backing Nan Rui

40:43.590 --> 40:45.190
and shutting the door on you.

40:45.190 --> 40:46.960
Are you planning to defy him
and steal the bride?

40:46.960 --> 40:47.840
Listen,

40:48.110 --> 40:49.550
until they're married,

40:49.590 --> 40:50.920
I've still got a chance.

40:52.030 --> 40:52.920
A chance of…

40:53.360 --> 40:55.430
of winning the Song family back.

40:57.190 --> 40:58.000
Sure,

40:58.150 --> 40:58.670
of course,

40:58.670 --> 41:00.070
you still stand a chance.

41:00.710 --> 41:02.770
You just can't get over Song Yimeng.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.860
What does this have to do with her?

41:05.170 --> 41:06.670
We've been planning this for so long.

41:06.670 --> 41:07.440
If we give up now,

41:07.440 --> 41:09.170
all our efforts will be wasted.

41:13.590 --> 41:15.030
You just can't get over Song Yimeng.

41:15.030 --> 41:16.000
Give me a break.

41:16.000 --> 41:17.480
When did I ever mention Song Yimeng?

41:17.480 --> 41:18.410
I brought her up.

41:18.630 --> 41:19.880
I brought her up.

41:23.280 --> 41:24.150
Anyway,

41:24.630 --> 41:27.290
we can't give up on
winning over the Song family.

41:27.360 --> 41:28.150
Also,

41:29.150 --> 41:30.630
there've been a lot of eyes

41:31.000 --> 41:32.470
on the prince's manor lately.

41:32.470 --> 41:34.400
I'll be meeting Chancellor Gao
at Waning River Crescent.

41:34.400 --> 41:35.630
Go make the arrangements.

41:35.630 --> 41:37.150
Don't let a single word get out.

41:37.150 --> 41:38.080
Understood.

41:41.110 --> 41:42.440
What are you looking at?

41:44.840 --> 41:45.150
You…

41:45.150 --> 41:45.590
Song Yimeng, Song Yimeng.

41:45.590 --> 41:47.120
You just can't get over her.

41:53.590 --> 41:54.320
She's getting married?

41:54.320 --> 41:55.440
Stop talking nonsense.

41:55.440 --> 41:56.840
No way Miss Song would marry someone else.

41:56.840 --> 41:58.260
Anyone who tries to steal Chief's woman

41:58.260 --> 41:58.930
is asking for death.

41:58.930 --> 41:59.600
Exactly.

41:59.620 --> 42:00.460
Like I said,

42:00.510 --> 42:01.560
pretty women can't be trusted.

42:01.560 --> 42:02.480
Chief treated her so well,

42:02.480 --> 42:03.190
and she still chose

42:03.190 --> 42:03.960
the rich general.

42:03.960 --> 42:04.800
Yeah.

42:04.800 --> 42:05.320
Just wait and see.

42:05.320 --> 42:06.590
She used to come by all the time.

42:06.590 --> 42:08.190
Now we'll probably never see her again.

42:08.190 --> 42:09.340
Yunlong, Shanhu.

42:11.150 --> 42:12.320
Where's Li Shiliu?
